ChatGPT Response Notifier 0.3.0

This project uses the completion-monitoring implementation from ChatGPT Response Complete Notifier by Ram Haidar (ramhaidar/ChatGPT-Response-Complete-Notifier), revision cbe00dcfcff8a571f407c6109ed4d5f97cef60a9.

For version 0.3.0, extension/content-script.js is kept byte-for-byte identical to the upstream file at that revision. The surrounding service-worker integration routes upstream completion events to this project's localhost Windows helper for persistent stacked notifications and managed updates without adding ChatGPT API polling.

